{
  "about": "The public example vocabulary for term_lookup: this repository's own glossary (docs/glossary.md), generated by tools/build-vocab.mjs. Drafted with AI assistance and not yet reviewed, so every term is draft and review level unknown. Point NDL_MCP_VOCAB_PATH at a governed register (for example the R2 vocabulary) to use real certified terms; that file is never copied into this repository.",
  "source": "docs/glossary.md",
  "terms": [
    {
